{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/da4434e1f318199a8e7928462518de73.avif?t=1772822289\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Dare to Enter</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shed Skin, Bleed Ink </strong>is a visually striking, boundary-breaking, experimental game where you explore\u2014or confine\u2014your identity by carving sigils into your flesh under the guidance of the Overseer. Your ultimate goal: to reincarnate as the Prophet in perfect alignment with the Observatory's sacred vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But to escape this cycle, you may need to look beyond the stars and deep into the files of this ritual...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/4665ecd5b8f59afaa568701fd57b2030.avif?t=1772822289\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Key Features</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/1caae92644be5bb0c189e2cd24efc979.poster.avif?t=1772822289\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/1caae92644be5bb0c189e2cd24efc979.webm?t=1772822289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/1caae92644be5bb0c189e2cd24efc979.mp4?t=1772822289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Find Sigils in a Fragmented Reality</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter a surreal realm transcending space and time, where broken realities collide. Each sigil you find is a piece of the sacred puzzle. Now, every decision you make will shape the reincarnation. Analyze and choose carefully\u2014each sigil carries weight in the rebirth of the Prophet.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Inscribe Sigils on Your Flesh</strong> <br><strong></strong><br><br>To forge the connection with the Prophet, you\u2019ll inscribe sigils onto your <strong><i>physical skin</i></strong>, bridging the gap between the digital and the physical world.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/7fb1beefc6ec5a036300659031e95f12.avif?t=1772822289\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras_big/7fb1beefc6ec5a036300659031e95f12.avif?t=1772822289 width=800 height=224 /></span><strong>Experience a Visually Striking Digital Ritual</strong> <br><strong></strong><br><br>Immerse yourself in a visually intense, 3D experimental world with sequences designed to provoke thought and challenge perception. (Warning: Some scenes may cause heavy eye strain.)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/7ab2953488bff52df1a8f8cefbcf8067.avif?t=1772822289\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Developers</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In creating the game for Peter Brinson's Intermediate course at USC, the developers aimed to make something weird and unique. They invite you to this boundary-pushing experience to explore identity in a new way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3290150?t=1772822289","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3290150?t=1772822289","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/540553b269cdfa455ba87aad1493a3909a1cd4bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772822289","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/540553b269cdfa455ba87aad1493a3909a1cd4bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772822289","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/da4434e1f318199a8e7928462518de73.avif?t=1772822289\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Dare to Enter</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shed Skin, Bleed Ink </strong>is a visually striking, boundary-breaking, experimental game where you explore\u2014or confine\u2014your identity by carving sigils into your flesh under the guidance of the Overseer. Your ultimate goal: to reincarnate as the Prophet in perfect alignment with the Observatory's sacred vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But to escape this cycle, you may need to look beyond the stars and deep into the files of this ritual...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/4665ecd5b8f59afaa568701fd57b2030.avif?t=1772822289\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Key Features</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/1caae92644be5bb0c189e2cd24efc979.poster.avif?t=1772822289\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/1caae92644be5bb0c189e2cd24efc979.webm?t=1772822289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/1caae92644be5bb0c189e2cd24efc979.mp4?t=1772822289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Find Sigils in a Fragmented Reality</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter a surreal realm transcending space and time, where broken realities collide. Each sigil you find is a piece of the sacred puzzle. Now, every decision you make will shape the reincarnation. Analyze and choose carefully\u2014each sigil carries weight in the rebirth of the Prophet.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Inscribe Sigils on Your Flesh</strong> <br><strong></strong><br><br>To forge the connection with the Prophet, you\u2019ll inscribe sigils onto your <strong><i>physical skin</i></strong>, bridging the gap between the digital and the physical world.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/7fb1beefc6ec5a036300659031e95f12.avif?t=1772822289\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras_big/7fb1beefc6ec5a036300659031e95f12.avif?t=1772822289 width=800 height=224 /></span><strong>Experience a Visually Striking Digital Ritual</strong> <br><strong></strong><br><br>Immerse yourself in a visually intense, 3D experimental world with sequences designed to provoke thought and challenge perception. (Warning: Some scenes may cause heavy eye strain.)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/7ab2953488bff52df1a8f8cefbcf8067.avif?t=1772822289\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Developers</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In creating the game for Peter Brinson's Intermediate course at USC, the developers aimed to make something weird and unique. They invite you to this boundary-pushing experience to explore identity in a new way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Anik Panja","Boston Moreland","Charles Greenberg","Nicholas Urricelqui","Senyao Yang"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/header.jpg?t=1772822289","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3290150/862685/39403eb4e41b28f01495cfec65d513f327a84ab8/1750976239/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744181580","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3290150/862685/39403eb4e41b28f01495cfec65d513f327a84ab8/1750976239/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744181580","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3290150/862685/39403eb4e41b28f01495cfec65d513f327a84ab8/1750976239/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744181580","id":257121522,"name":"Trailer Main","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121522/53c3f75d413605a4a38546d8aabadae65d2c474c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744181580"}],"name":"Shed Skin, Bleed Ink","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["USC Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"6 Mar, 2026"},"required_age":0,"s